        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-4050] If EVCC is using ServiceName = DC_ACDP, in Table 204, after receiving the ScheduleExchangeRes with \"ResponseCode = OK\", and EVSEProcessing set to \"Finished\", the EVCC shall send a ACDP_ConnectReq within V2G_EVCC_Sequence_Performance_Timeout according to Table 215.",
