            "block_content": "[V2G20-4051] If EVCC is using ServiceName = DC_ACDP, after receiving the ACDP_ConnectRes with \"ResponseCode = OK\" and EVSEProcessing set to \"Ongoing\", the EVCC shall send another ACDP_ConnectReq within V2G_EVCC_Sequence_Performance_Timeout according to Table 215.",
